msgstr "<strong>Betalingsterminaler</strong>"

#. module: clothing_boutique
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:clothing_boutique.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Tags </strong>can be used to categorize your products: a clothing "
"item can be part of both the\n"
"            summer collection, the discounts section, and the accessories "
"section, for example."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Tags </strong>kan bruges til at kategorisere dine produkter: Et "
"stykke tøj kan for eksempel både indgå i\n"
"            sommerkollektionen, udsalgssektionen og tilbehørssektionen."

#. module: clothing_boutique
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:clothing_boutique.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Use automatic reordering rules:</strong> to keep stock levels where "
"they should be"
msgstr ""
"<strong>Brug genbestillingsreglerne:</strong> til at holde lagerbeholdningen "
"på det rette niveau"

